## EvolutionApi

### List evolution chains
## List evolution chains
GET https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/evolution-chain/?limit={{limit}}&offset={{offset}}&q={{q}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Basic: {{username-password}}
Cookie: sessionid={{cookieKey}}

### Get evolution chain
## Get evolution chain
GET https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/evolution-chain/{{id}}/
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Basic: {{username-password}}
Cookie: sessionid={{cookieKey}}

### List evolution triggers
## List evolution triggers
GET https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/evolution-trigger/?limit={{limit}}&offset={{offset}}&q={{q}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Basic: {{username-password}}
Cookie: sessionid={{cookieKey}}

### Get evolution trigger
## Get evolution trigger
GET https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/evolution-trigger/{{id}}/
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Basic: {{username-password}}
Cookie: sessionid={{cookieKey}}
